372 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 216 0 R/E(Hashtags: We will use hashtags relevant to the post. For example, Furry Friend Friday will always have #FurryFriendFriday. The Hashtags we will use in every post are #AnimalHealthCareCenter, #WellingtonFL, #VetMed, #PetLovers)/Pg 19 0 R/K[2]>>
