379 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 217 0 R/T(Of the twelve brand archetypes, Animal HealthCare Center perfectly fits under \217the caregiver.\220 Being in healthcare, it makes sense that we fit under this specific archetype. The goal of this archetype is to \215care for and protect others.\216 The traits are \215caring and compassionate\216 \(The 12 Brand Archetypes, n.d.\), which describe our brand to a T. If Animal HealthCare Center were a celebrity, it would be Steve Irwin. Steve dedicated his life to helping animals and educating people about these animals, which is exactly what we do here: providing compassionate care for each animal and explaining the process every step of the way to our clients. )/E(Of the twelve brand archetypes, Animal HealthCare Center perfectly fits under \217the caregiver.\220 Being in healthcare, it makes sense that we fit under this specific archetype. The goal of this archetype is to \215care for and protect others.\216 The traits are \215caring and compassionate\216 \(The 12 Brand Archetypes, n.d.\), which describe our brand to a T. If Animal HealthCare Center were a celebrity, it would be Steve Irwin. Steve dedicated his life to helping animals and educating people about these animals, which is exactly what we do here: providing compassionate care for each animal and explaining the process every step of the way to our clients. )/Pg 20 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

