<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 220 0 R/T(Visual Guidelines:  The way the pictures are arranged and the length of the caption are all submission dependent. The arrangement depends on the number and the orientation of the photos, whereas the caption is dependent on how many fun facts the client sends over with the picture. The background and the Lovelace font are both in the HEX #242b51 color and the font has the lift effect at the default setting. The shorthand logo is present on the screen sitting on the white \(HEX #ffffff\) background. This content is a campaign we do to feature our clients pets to show our appreciation for them. It will be posted on Fridays at 9:45 am. )/E(Visual Guidelines:  The way the pictures are arranged and the length of the caption are all submission dependent. The arrangement depends on the number and the orientation of the photos, whereas the caption is dependent on how many fun facts the client sends over with the picture. The background and the Lovelace font are both in the HEX #242b51 color and the font has the lift effect at the default setting. The shorthand logo is present on the screen sitting on the white \(HEX #ffffff\) background. This content is a campaign we do to feature our clients pets to show our appreciation for them. It will be posted on Fridays at 9:45 am. )/Pg 23 0 R/K[2]>>
