434 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 223 0 R/T(If your pet is microchipped, you can check their microchip number on their PetDesk app or call us at \(561\)-432-9997 to get the number. Once you have the ID number, enter it at http://petmicrochiplookup.org to verify and update the information associated with your pet's microchip.  Keeping your pet's microchip information current helps reunite lost pets with their families. Let\220s make sure your pets are safe and secure! )/E(If your pet is microchipped, you can check their microchip number on their PetDesk app or call us at \(561\)-432-9997 to get the number. Once you have the ID number, enter it at http://petmicrochiplookup.org to verify and update the information associated with your pet's microchip.  Keeping your pet's microchip information current helps reunite lost pets with their families. Let\220s make sure your pets are safe and secure! )/Pg 26 0 R/K[3 519 0 R 5]>>
endobj

