<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 228 0 R/T(Minor Issues)/E(Minor Issues)/Pg 31 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

484 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 228 0 R/T(Major Issues)/E(Major Issues)/Pg 31 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

485 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 228 0 R/T( If the issue is minor, such as long wait times, the social media manager will respond, and a department head will be notified so that they are aware of the situation. We would apologize to the client for the inconvenience and let them know that we have notified the relevant department and invite them to DM us if they would like to discuss the issue further.)/E( If the issue is minor, such as long wait times, the social media manager will respond, and a department head will be notified so that they are aware of the situation. We would apologize to the client for the inconvenience and let them know that we have notified the relevant department and invite them to DM us if they would like to discuss the issue further.)/Pg 31 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

486 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 228 0 R/T(If a client leaves feedback with a serious concern or claim, it will be immediately escalated to the highest level of management, and two statements will be released: an initial statement and a final statement. We will not respond directly to comments under social posts; instead, the hospital manager or the medical director will contact the client directly through DM or phone call. If reaching out through DM, the tone will be formal and empathetic. )/E(If a client leaves feedback with a serious concern or claim, it will be immediately escalated to the highest level of management, and two statements will be released: an initial statement and a final statement. We will not respond directly to comments under social posts; instead, the hospital manager or the medical director will contact the client directly through DM or phone call. If reaching out through DM, the tone will be formal and empathetic. )/Pg 31 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

487 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 228 0 R/E(There are a few rules when it comes to engaging our customers online. We do respond to every comment as it shows customers and potential customers that we care and are committed to providing good customer service, but depending on the severity of the negative response, AHCC can handle negative feedback in several ways)/Pg 31 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

488 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 228 0 R/E(These rules are the same if someone posts a negative review on Google or other review platforms)/Pg 31 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

