495 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 229 0 R/E(When handling engagement from competitors, it is simple. We will always maintain a respectful and professional tone with them. We will acknowledge their engagement politely but will not try to further the conversation to avoid any unnecessary remarks about one another. The response is the same for internet trolls as well. )/Pg 32 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

496 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 229 0 R/E(Providing photo credit or content credit is a big thing we do on AHCC\220s social pages, especially since we feature clients' pets weekly on our social pages. Our credit-giving process is also simple. When using their pictures in our graphics, we thank them by name and tag them in the post. If we were to use a graphic from another brand, we would follow the same guidelines as the ones above.)/Pg 32 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

