2040 0 obj
<</Title(A target audience is \215the speci\223c group of consumers most likely to want your product or service\216 \(Marketing Evolution, n.d.\). Understanding this target audience helps us create relevant messaging to get better results. Our online audience is made up of primarily women \(80%\) whose ages range between 35-64 years old. The largest group is 45-54 years old, with the 55-64 and 35-44 age groups not far behind, making this group our target audience. These women live mainly in Wellington, Florida, but can also be located in the surrounding areas such as Greenacres, West Palm Beach, and Loxahatchee. This demographic consists of both high school and college-educated individuals, and their income level is middle to upper-class. These individuals are also either still working or retired. The target audience takes a special interest in pet health and wellness and animal care and values compassion, trust, and expertise. These individuals actively schedule veterinary appointments and are proactive about their pet\220s health. This group is also active on social media and is taking a special interest in pet-related content, such as national pet holidays and pet videos.)/Dest[14 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2007 0 R/Next 2060 0 R>>
endobj

