endobj

2044 0 obj
<</Title(If the issue is minor, such as long wait times, the social media manager will respond, and a department head will be notified so that they are aware of the situation. We would apologize to the client for the inconvenience and let them know that we have notified the relevant department and invite them to DM us if they would like to discuss the issue further.)/Dest[31 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2010 0 R/Next 2045 0 R>>
endobj

2045 0 obj
<</Title(If a client leaves feedback with a serious concern or claim, it will be immediately escalated to the highest level of management, and two statements will be released: an initial statement and a final statement. We will not respond directly to comments under social posts; instead, the hospital manager or the medical director will contact the client directly through DM or phone call. If reaching out through DM, the tone will be formal and empathetic.)/Dest[31 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2010 0 R/Prev 2044 0 R>>
endobj

